            { title: "Everybody Writes — Ann Handley (2nd ed., 2022)", body: "Everybody is a writer now, and good writing is a learnable habit: the ugly first draft, important words first, edit in passes.", meta: "Tabs: copywriting, organic-social · Guide ch 10, 12" }
